  canonicalPath="/license.html"
  updatedText="GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0-only)"
>
  <div class="legal-highlight">
    <strong>Summary:</strong> AI Chat Exporter is open-source software distributed under the
    <strong>GNU Affero General Public License Version 3 (AGPL-3.0-only)</strong> with an additional
    <strong>FOSS Linking Exception</strong>. You are free to inspect, audit, fork, and contribute.
    Any OSI-approved open source projects may freely link, import, or bundle these components.
  </div>

  <div class="legal-body">
    <h2>1. Overview</h2>
    <p>
      AI Chat Exporter is designed with privacy and open source values at its core. The complete
      source code is available on
      <a href="https://github.com/Covai-Labs/ace" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        GitHub
      </a>
      .
    </p>

    <h2>2. License Text</h2>
    <p>Below is the full text of the license and FOSS Linking Exception:</p>
    <pre class="license-block">{agpl3}</pre>
  </div>
